      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell"><![CDATA[prefetch 72820314FD5230A22E180E3B453F648908D6C51E.dmg sha1:72820314FD5230A22E180E3B453F648908D6C51E size:86166964 https://download.mozilla.org/?product=firefox-51.0.1-SSL&os=osx&lang=en-US sha256:4B8EDDA773A93CBA293789C2BE1B1687FE309DEE91589F9D2A9A71CC2C1BCB1C

